5. HIDMaestro v1.6.1 integration (MIT upstream material)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Upstream: https://github.com/hifihedgehog/HIDMaestro/releases/tag/v1.6.1
    Source revision: 2a0dac0857901a63d365a36dcf99cf50114ca954
    License: MIT
    Full text: THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/HIDMaestro.txt
    Used in: ksx-hidmaestro-host.exe
             optional setup-time official download

The Windows installer builds a fixed elevated runtime host for one DualSense
from the exact reviewed v1.6.1 source. Its separate installer-only bootstrap
contains no upstream binary. After explicit setup consent it downloads the
official v1.6.1 archive, verifies the archive and all three managed assemblies
by pinned length and SHA-256, invokes HIDMaestro's package installation in an
isolated worker, waits for that worker to exit, and deletes the temporary SDK.
The ordinary ksx daemon and runtime host neither embed driver-install authority
nor download HIDMaestro.

The official release also contains Microsoft SDK/WDK dependencies governed by
their own terms. They are fetched from upstream only for the explicit setup
operation and are not redistributed in a KSX artifact.


