FormaJS core uses `alien-signals` 3.1.2 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024-present
Johnson Chu) as its signal engine, and that implementation is bundled into the
generated Studio JavaScript. Its full license is installed as
`THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/alien-signals-MIT.txt`.


