7. libwdi 1.5.1 prepare provider (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Upstream: https://github.com/pbatard/libwdi
    Source revision: 9b23b82a2dd1cbffc16d46c212f92c6bf8c0c602
    License: LGPL-3.0-or-later
    Full texts: THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/libwdi-LGPL-3.0-or-later.txt
                THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt
    Binary: libwdi.dll
    Complete corresponding source: THIRD-PARTY-SOURCE/libwdi/

KSX dynamically loads a modified x64, prepare-only libwdi DLL to create and
sign a catalog for one canonical in-box WinUSB INF. The distributed ABI exports
only `wdi_is_driver_supported`, `wdi_prepare_driver`, and `wdi_strerror`; it
does not enumerate devices or install/remove packages. No Zadig/wdi-simple
application, WDK/coinstaller, libusb driver, installer helper, private key, or
network downloader is included.

The installed distribution includes the complete modified source, build and
verification scripts, canonical INF template, upstream notices, and LGPL/GPL
texts under `THIRD-PARTY-SOURCE/libwdi/`. `libwdi.dll` is a separate,
dynamically loaded work and may be replaced with a compatible modified build;
KSX does not require a fixed DLL hash. The portable ZIP omits the helper, DLL,
and corresponding source together because WinUSB preparation is installed-only.


